1
00:00:00.397 --> 00:00:03.336
Unit undefined. My Friends!

2
00:00:04.364 --> 00:00:09.350
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.066
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.116 --> 00:00:16.719
Today we learn: My Friends. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.064 --> 00:00:21.347
Friend. Say it with me. Friend!

6
00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:28.130
Play. Say it with me. Play!

7
00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:35.247
Share. Say it with me. Share!

8
00:00:38.752 --> 00:00:42.469
Kind. Say it with me. Kind!

9
00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:49.592
Together. Say it with me. Together!

10
00:00:53.088 --> 00:00:57.155
Smile. Say it with me. Smile!

11
00:01:00.672 --> 00:01:04.005
Help. Say it with me. Help!

12
00:01:07.503 --> 00:01:10.803
Fun. Say it with me. Fun!

13
00:01:14.324 --> 00:01:24.850
Grammar time! My friend is + adjective. Listen. My friend is kind. My friend is fun.

14
00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:31.246
Your turn. Say it with me. My friend is kind. My friend is fun.

15
00:01:36.039 --> 00:01:46.434
I have many friends at school. We play together and share our toys. My friends are kind, and we always help each other. Playing together is fun!

16
00:01:46.484 --> 00:01:47.904
I like this story!

17
00:01:48.621 --> 00:01:54.200
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:55.400
Share!

19
00:01:56.382 --> 00:02:01.892
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:01.942 --> 00:02:03.010
Help!

21
00:02:03.702 --> 00:02:12.174
Think and answer. Who is your best friend, and what do you like to play together?

22
00:02:12.224 --> 00:02:13.374
Great answer!

23
00:02:14.435 --> 00:02:16.648
This unit's value is Friendship.

24
00:02:16.698 --> 00:02:18.393
I can show friendship every day!

25
00:02:19.094 --> 00:02:23.668
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:23.718 --> 00:02:25.359
Bye-bye, friends!

